---
title: Baked Bacon
source: https://easyfamilyrecipes.com/bacon-in-the-oven/
---

Lay the @sliced bacon{12%oz} in a single layer on a foil-lined #baking sheet{}.

Sprinkle with @brown sugar{} and/or @paprika{}, if desired.

Place the bacon in a cold oven. Set the oven for 400 degrees.

Bake for ~{18-30%minutes}, or until the bacon reaches desired crispiness.
